eyes MD\" is a controlled medical device (generic name: program for general-purpose diagnostic imaging workstations, certification number: 302ADBZX00011000) under the \"Act on Quality, Efficacy and Safety Assurance of Pharmaceuticals, Medical Devices, etc.\" (Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Act)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "md_logo.png", "id": "5998065973633964", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003260_5998065976967297_260827317627691552_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TYbryhavWOwQ7kNvwEGKTN0&_nc_oc=AdlhlVAnX6gIXdFtAroljhwxWhzsH0Tr1e3kqL6lyv0djf_CSvcLOhxI4l4AJIYddCQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvnEsjf5zeAoENj9QU5-hQSQgsjWcNdoNPrxs1uXQAB_A&oe=69A581CD"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_tate.png", "id": "2303415159832893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974904_2303415163166226_7688600240374808365_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_lklAWV_J3UQ7kNvwGecTQD&_nc_oc=AdmFhByxNW_gnn8TAXC9Hd6pZtLMi0ydzL6HdsKFEmcFS8meXuclZWcfJ7ZpP_fR2XI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvuqIhaHtSC0Y_iZnY0hSmoCdBzCujGu3VmltFCToHHzg&oe=69A5742C"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_miniyoko.png", "id": "950325029433473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031585_950325032766806_6345836855774372629_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5-E36VbbpgwQ7kNvwGwuLjT&_nc_oc=Adn3jjmp1l9sWkqER7WnvQvdfodgh0hjGXmTyvUbinAg8CV6NIjfAUjT6f22niOV6kU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuM-Ozg_oRteM6JPkZplzI2ZGpFeQa29pkTZpLxDrxPfA&oe=69A595BD"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_yoko.png", "id": "773168277532939", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223486_773168280866272_6988374572968566012_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tUToop7vh7QQ7